10. In view of the nature of the allegations leveled against the Petitioners, the completion of investigation, and the filing of the charge sheet, this Court is inclined to grant pre-arrest bail to the Petitioners with the following stringent conditions:
a) In the event of arrest of the petitioners/accused Nos.1 to 7shall be enlarged on bail on executing a personal bond for a sum of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees ten thousand only)each with two sureties for the like sum each to the satisfaction of the arresting police officials;
b) The Petitioners/accused Nos.1 to 7 shall appear before the learned trial Court on every adjournment and shall cooperate with the trial.

